COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj."CompanyIntegrationRun"."OwnerToken" IS 'Opaque token identifying the process currently executing this run. NULL = unowned. Set atomically by spClaimCompanyIntegrationRun; a claim succeeds only when the run is unowned or its lease has expired. Cleared by spReleaseCompanyIntegrationRun.';

